; The one variable: the target's parent is scaled (2, 1, 1) and the target is turned 45° about Z, so
; its global basis is sheared. A position-only relay leaves that basis as it is and moves only the
; origin (remote_transform_3d.cpp:63-99). Every other RemoteTransform golden drives a target under
; an unscaled parent, so none of them shows a regression in it.

